ecycleTracking/documentation/LifecycleTracking/LifecycleObservation/finish()":{"title":"finish()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"finish"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/lifecycletracking\/lifecycleobservation\/finish()","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Ends the app’s lifecycle: stops observing it, then tracks "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationTerminated","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unless one was tracked already or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation\/Kind\/terminated","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is off, and makes the tracker’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"records durable as on backgrounding. Returns once that is done, or at once if tracking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"was cancelled."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation\/finish()","role":"symbol"},"doc://LifecycleTracking/documentation/LifecycleTracking/ApplicationBackgrounded":{"url":"\/documentation\/lifecycletracking\/applicationbackgrounded","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The app moved to the background: what "},{"code":"trackLifecycle","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" tracks each time the app leaves the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"foreground (on macOS, each time it stops being the active app)."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ApplicationBackgrounded"}],"title":"ApplicationBackgrounded","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword